      "text": "Isaac went out to meditate in the field, Gen. 24:63. book of the law … thou shalt meditate therein, Josh. 1:8 (Ps. 1:2). Lord, consider my meditation, Ps. 5:1. Let … the meditation of my heart, be acceptable, Ps. 19:14. meditate on thee in the night, Ps. 63:6. I will meditate also of all thy work, Ps. 77:12. My meditation of him shall be sweet, Ps. 104:34. I will meditate in thy precepts, Ps. 119:15. thy testimonies are my meditation, Ps. 119:99. I meditate on all thy works, Ps. 143:5. Consider your ways, Hag. 1:7.",
